Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.80,Line,,,,,Let's play soccer, come with Pip!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.60,Line,,,,,Here's the ball — give it a kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.40,Line,,,,,Use your feet, not your hands — oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:07.20,Line,,,,,Kick the ball and watch it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.00,Line,,,,,See the net? That's called the goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.80,Line,,,,,Kick it in — you're on a roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.20,Line,,,,,When you score, what do we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.60,Big,,,,,GOAL! Hip hip hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.00,Line,,,,,Kick, and cheer — that's what we do!
